os/godotengine/godot/issues/118254","id":4196705964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76JKas","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T05:18:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T05:25:45Z","body":"I'm not strictly against it, but:\r\n\r\n1. Currently, there are no optional or variadic signal parameters. When emitting a signal, you must pass all declared parameters, as this is part of the contract (even though Godot doesn't validate the number and types of parameters). This means that in most cases, variadic signal emission is unnecessary. Or, at the very least, the presence of such a method in the API encourages the misuse of signals.\r\n2. If necessary, you can use `my_signal.emit.callv(args)`, `emit_signal.callv([&\"my_signal\"] + args)`, etc.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4196705964/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4200869419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118254#issuecomment-4200869419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118254","id":4200869419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76ZC4r","user":{"login":"Efra-EMX","id":114894326,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtkl9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114894326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX","html_url":"https://github.com/Efra-EMX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Efra-EMX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T17:09:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T17:09:09Z","body":">     2. If necessary, you can use `my_signal.emit.callv(args)`, `emit_signal.callv([&\"my_signal\"] + args)`, etc.\r\n\r\nYou are absolutely right, I feel a bit dumb now because I forgot `emit()` is a Callable and that means I could've just straight up use `callv()` on it instead of getting out of my way to implement this xD\r\n\r\nThat means there's not really any need for `emitv()` other than for making it shorter","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4200869419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]